%N A401951 Number of labeled connected graphs with n vertices in which every edge belongs to a triangle.
%F A401951 Let A(x) = Sum_{n>=1} a(n)*x^n/n! and B(x) = Sum_{n>=2} A401952(n)*x^n/n!. Then x*A'(x) = x*exp(B'(x*A'(x))).
%e A401951 a(4) = 7: the only connected graphs on 4 vertices in which every edge belongs to a triangle are K_4 and K_4 with one edge deleted. There are 1 + binomial(4,2) = 7 labeled graphs.
%Y A401951 Cf. A396149 (unlabeled connected graphs), A401950 (unlabeled 2-connected graphs), A401952 (labeled 2-connected graphs), all with the property that every edge belongs to a triangle.
%K A401951 nonn,hard,more,new
